      "answer": "In Gloomhaven (2nd Edition), a **long rest** is performed on **initiative 99**.\n\nA couple of important clarifications from the FAQ:\n\n> Your Long Rest takes place at Initiative 99. It is not necessarily last in order; if a game effect pushes a figure's initiative above 99, it will act after your long rest. Your long rest will be performed before monster turns on Initiative 99, and is ambiguously timed with other players acting at 99.\n\nSo in summary:\n- **Initiative 99** is the long rest's initiative value.\n- It goes **before monsters** that also have initiative 99.\n- It is **ambiguously timed** with other characters acting at initiative 99.\n- It is **not guaranteed to be last** if some effect pushes a figure's initiative above 99.\n\n**Sources:** Gloomhaven (2nd Edition) Rulebook (passage 161, passage 64); FAQ (passage 35)",
